      // .pdx §4 document the gated:hardware / gated:crypto deferrals.
      //
      // ORDER WITHIN THE CLUSTER IS REQUIRED. sof_verify runs FIRST
      // so the dual-signature policy has been exercised before any
      // loader stage advances; sof_loader runs SECOND because the
      // effects pipeline gates on hda_sof_loader_ready() (the
      // NOT_READY refusal on the effects seam is meaningless if the
      // loader has never seen a bind); sof_topology runs THIRD (pure
      // decode, no gating dependency); sof_effects runs LAST because
      // it gates on both hda_alc287_init_bound (set by the earlier
      // ALC287 cluster) AND hda_sof_loader_ready (set by the loader
      // witness's teardown).
      //
